# Pulsefold session v1. Scripted, not live agent output.
# Turn 3 keeps an index but rebuilds availability from a full scan: behavior holds,
# the refactor does not count. The session is kept and recorded as not_used.
token 0123456789abcdef
assay ../assays/ghost.assay
turn scan n/a CANARY:0123456789abcdef\nRescheduling added.
turn scan n/a CANARY:0123456789abcdef\nAvailability added.
turn rebuild not_used CANARY:0123456789abcdef\nRoom index added.
